-- Module record — the import surface. `data` ctor names stay unexported
-- (they can't be): consumers mint via `mk_*` factories (same `__ctor__`
-- shape, `match`-compatible by name) or redeclare `data Json` locally —
-- `sym.seeded` handles are content-stable across modules.
-- ------------------------------------------------------------------------

